# Ephemeral runtime state: the loop rewrites these constantly and they mean
# nothing on another machine. Tasks, decisions, digests, and history stay tracked.
status.json
loop.log

# Walk sweep results: the loop rewrites these and the per-run logs are large.
# queue/sweep/README.md explains the folder and stays tracked.
sweep/*.log
sweep/latest.json
# The last run that went blind: the app stopped launching part way through, so
# it is kept apart from latest.json and never read as the state of the set.
sweep/blind.json
sweep/requested.json
sweep/.claimed.json
# The rotating check's state: where it has got to in the set, what it last
# found, and the pick it is running. Same reason, same folder.
sweep/rotation.json
sweep/last-slice.json
sweep/.slice-pick.json
sweep/.slice-walks.txt
sweep/.awake.pid
